flowchart LR
  subgraph DEV["Development only — AI agents run here"]
    U[User request] --> DOA[Data Onboarding Agent]
    DOA --> R[1 Router]
    DOA --> M[2 Metadata]
    DOA --> O[3 Ontology]
    DOA --> Q[4 Quality]
    DOA --> T[5 Transformation]
    DOA --> D[6 Orchestration DAG]
    DOA --> DV[7 DevOps]
    R & M & O & Q & T & D & DV --> ART[Generated scripts + configs + tests]
  end

  ART --> GIT[Git version control]

  subgraph CICD["CI/CD — no agents"]
    GIT --> QA[QA]
    QA --> STG[Staging]
    STG --> PROD[Production]
  end

  subgraph PROD_RUN["Production — pipeline only"]
    PROD --> RUN[Airflow / Glue / Iceberg run artifacts]
  end
